# Audit segments written by a local run. The chain is per-machine and per-process,
# so it is never shared -- but benchmarks/results/ IS committed on purpose: the
# README points readers at ledger.jsonl as the evidence behind every published
# number, and a benchmark section citing a file nobody can see is exactly the kind
# of unbacked claim the rest of this project avoids.
